# SIGNET Environment Variables — Full Live Testnet

Copy to `.env.local` (project root) **and** `server/.env` (x402 server).

See [docs/API_KEYS.md](docs/API_KEYS.md) for step-by-step instructions to obtain each value.

## Database (required)

```
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...
```

Run `supabase/migrations/001_initial.sql` in Supabase SQL Editor.

## Algorand testnet wallets (required)

```
ALGORAND_ALGOD_URL=https://testnet-api.algonode.cloud
ALGORAND_INDEXER_URL=https://testnet-idx.algonode.cloud
AVM_ADDRESS=YOUR_ANALYST_ADDRESS
ANALYST_MNEMONIC=25 word phrase for analyst
BUYER_MNEMONIC=25 word phrase for buyer
BUYER_ADDRESS=YOUR_BUYER_ADDRESS
```

Fund: ALGO → https://lora.algokit.io/testnet/fund  
Fund: USDC → https://faucet.circle.com (Algorand Testnet)

## x402 server (required)

```
FACILITATOR_URL=https://facilitator.goplausible.xyz
X402_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:4021
VITE_X402_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:4021
VITE_APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
PORT=4021
```

## OpenAI — analyst agent (required)

```
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
```

Get key: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys

## Signal pricing (testnet — default $0.01 for E2E)

```
SIGNAL_PRICE_USDC=0.01
```

## Alpha Arcade — reputation (required for full live)

```
ALPHA_API_KEY=your_alpha_partners_key
ALPHA_NETWORK=testnet
ALPHA_ALGOD_SERVER=https://testnet-api.algonode.cloud
ALPHA_INDEXER_SERVER=https://testnet-idx.algonode.cloud
ALPHA_MATCHER_APP_ID=
ALPHA_USDC_ASA_ID=10458941
```

Get key: https://alphaarcade.com → Account → Partners → Create API key

## Folks Finance — xALGO treasury (recommended)

Uses Folks SDK testnet defaults when app IDs are empty. Live pool reads use Folks bundled algosdk.

```
FOLKS_XALGO_APP_ID=
FOLKS_XALGO_ASA_ID=
AUTO_STAKE_XALGO=true
```

Set `AUTO_STAKE_XALGO=true` for on-chain staking after analyst revenue accrues.
